<title>USA: Caterpillar names dealer for Mongolia.</title>
<headline>Caterpillar names dealer for Mongolia.</headline>
<dateline>PEORIA, Ill. 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Caterpillar Inc said Monday it appointed a new independently owned dealership to serve customers in Mongolia.</p>
<p>The new dealership, Wagner International LLC, is owned by shareholders of Wagner Equipment Corp in Aurora, Colorado.</p>
<p>The agreement authorizes the dealership to perform all the traditional functions of a Catarpillar dealer, including prime product and parts sales, delivery and warranty service.</p>
<p>Caterpillar manufactures earthmoving and construction equipment and gas engines.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
